      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>In your n[ame], O Merc[iful]</li>\n<li>Prescription of a musk remedy to be taken for tremor, palpitation, and desolation.</li>\n<li>Take mastic, cinnamon, clove, Indian spikenard, [...]</li>\n<li>tablets, nutmeg, cubeb, black cardamom, cardamom, galingale, [...],</li>\n<li>aloeswood incense, citron leaf,&nbsp;<i>faranjamushk,&nbsp;</i>which is the kernel(?)</li>\n<li>of the clove, basil seed, marjoram, wild thyme, ginger, and long</li>\n<li>pepper, ten&nbsp;<i>dirham</i>s of each; pearl, coral, amber,</li>\n<li>raw silk, red behen, white behen, and Indian laurel,</li>\n<li>ten&nbsp;<i>dirham</i>s of each; pure musk weighing two&nbsp;<i>d\u0101niq</i>s.</li>\n<li>Combine it after the grinding and the sieving, and knead it in honey of chebulic&nbsp;</li>\n<li>myrobalan preserves. Effective, God willing.&nbsp;</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
